<p>In the "Dragon Age\tools\ResourceBuild\Processors" folder there is an executable named "ExcelProcessor.exe". This is the file that handles conversions of 2DAs from XLS to <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GDA" title="GDA">GDA</a> format. Below are described 3 ways in which this file may be used.
</p><p><br />
</p>
